==Description== <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The [[Image:Silk_Point_onCurve.svg|24px]] '''Silk Point_onCurve''' command creates a point, a Point_onCurve object, on a [[Image:Silk_CubicCurve_4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicCurve_4|CubicCurve_4]] or a [[Image:Silk_CubicCurve_6.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicCurve_6|CubicCurve_6]] (also works on some curves outside of Silk).

